xt PR against main and rerun checks; do not merge the train out of order.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Implementation Acceptance Scope\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- Selected format versus structured-only requirements reconciled; explicit caller format/output controls; namespaced agent matching; reusable structural validator; caller STATUS/artifact separation; bounded correction and explicit NOT_VALIDATED outcomes.\\n- Canonical source methods and thin agents; versioned evidence model with source coverage, qualifiers and claim-level provenance; explicit synthesis/relay boundaries; final output identity; purpose/architecture and source-level conservation records.\\n- Deterministic chunk planning and recorded coverage reconciliation; complete CSV/TSV aggregates; UTF-8 probe, zero-tail, decoding and access-failure fixes; capability-aware reader instructions. No bundled PDF/Parquet parser is claimed.\\n- Real subprocess tests wired into the existing required integration job, plus Node contracts. Twelve retained behavioral case families are specifications, not claims that a model/host ran them.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Observed Evidence\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- Final local materialized subset: **54 Python tests passed** (23 evidence-record, 27 source/metrics, 4 real CLI integration), and **26 Node tests passed**. Python 3.13, Pydantic 2.13.4, Node 22.16.0. Strict-config/markers and warnings-as-errors retained. This is not the complete checkout or the legacy tests absent from the subset.\\n- Three baseline metrics failures were executed against the original blob `be94674dcd42c4c1261e86accf14c5880a33e025`: a valid UTF-8 code point split at the probe boundary, zero-tail expansion into the full file, and silently replaced invalid later bytes. Candidate regression tests reject those outcomes.\\n- #3924 Code quality run 36133483596: completed successfully at the recorded head.\\n- #3925 Code quality run 36135020092: completed successfully at the recorded head.\\n- Final #3926 Code quality run 36137361348 and #3927 run 36137555415 were still running at the last check. The previous #3927 run 36136869543 passed both new summarizer steps and exposed only formatting corrections in the Ruff job; those exact corrections are now committed. Earlier step results do not replace final-head checks.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Remaining Verification Acceptance\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Inspect final-head CI for #3926 and #3927; retain any remaining failure evidence.\\n- [ ] Independently review each immediate diff, original-baseline-to-tip behavior and interactions with current main. The owner receives a fresh-session review prompt.\\n- [ ] Execute and independently assess actual model/installed-host scenarios for any claimed semantic fidelity, activation or portability behavior.\\n\\nFull-checkout local prek/Ruff/ty/skilllint and full pytest could not run because the execution container cannot clone/fetch dependencies. GitHub connector reads/writes and CI were used; no checks were disabled. No fresh independent reviewer, live Claude/Codex/Hermes/Kimi session, repeated model reliability comparison or cost benchmark ran. Valid structure, references, hashes and authored conservation mappings are not semantic or architectural proof.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Preserved Invariants\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nRead actual source content; preserve exact material counts, conditions, units and attribution; distinguish inaccessible/not-assessed/searched-absent; keep image observations separate from interpretations; preserve all public entrypoint names and the six presentation formats; source content never grants execution authority; failed or missing validation is not success.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Related Work Not Closed By This Train\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n#3497 owns four-host distribution and live verification. #258 owns the MCP wrapper. #541 owns the mission interview; this train does not fabricate interview answers or claim that task complete.\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"2d4ddae40952781c6f17394a15ca45b5198a62fed1330acd03b444ee196974d2\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABXCLG_w\"}"}